e
>> >> 11.1 and Ubuntu 9.10 alpha6 which I described in my posting on LKML
>> >> titled: "Poor desktop responsiveness with background I/O-operations" =
of
>> >> 2009-09-20.
>> >> (Message ID: 4AB59CBB.8090907@datenparkplatz.de)
>> >>
